{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>蔡天鳳案｜指下午聞電鋸聲撞擊聲 龍尾村住戶︰晚上飄「青紅蘿蔔湯」香味</strong></p><p>・案件疑涉下午電鋸及撞擊聲<br>・龍尾村住戶晚上聞到異味<br>・住戶形容為「青紅蘿蔔湯」香味<br>・事件引起村內居民關注</p><p>暫時未能從am730擷取全文。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.am730.com.hk/本地/1059657/蔡天鳳案-指下午聞電鋸聲撞擊聲-龍尾村住戶-晚上飄-青紅蘿蔔湯-香味\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T18:01:45.579234+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"minimal","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T20:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T20:37:57.041157+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:58:04.794346+00:00","content_hash":"0122ea82a6b345c25cf04a153a95ce9fd34b3d3e2ee898e7b8b98634210f0cab","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}